@startuml
title JSON definitions and evaluation - target, not deployed configuration
component "Numeric flow rule JSON\nand validation" as numericRules
component "Maturity definitions and validation\nBF01 candidate-only integration" as semanticRules
component "Shared evidence, signals\nand provenance" as evidence
component "Numeric evaluation:\nmeasurements, signals and thresholds" as numeric
component "Maturity evidence acquisition\nand projection" as projection
component "Maturity semantic evaluation:\nBF01 candidate-only integration" as semantic
component "Role Profile Builder and profiles\nfuture, not prerequisite" as profiles
component "Shared outcomes and provenance;\ndiagnostic evidence sufficiency" as outcomes
component "Eligible diagnostic\ninsight candidate" as diagnosticCandidate
component "Diagnostic evaluation:\nconfidence then priority" as diagnosticEvaluation
component "Diagnostic composition,\ninsight and presentation" as diagnosticInsight
component "Operational MRI:\nrelationship evaluation" as mri
component "Eligible MRI system\ninsight candidate" as mriCandidate
component "System evaluation:\nconfidence then priority" as systemEvaluation
component "System insight composition\nand presentation" as systemInsight
component "Shared Intelligence Trace\n(target contract)" as trace
numericRules --> numeric
semanticRules --> semantic
evidence --> numeric
evidence --> projection : original selections
evidence ..> profiles : future
profiles ..> projection : future interpreted evidence
projection --> semantic
numeric --> outcomes
semantic --> outcomes
evidence --> outcomes
outcomes --> diagnosticCandidate
diagnosticCandidate --> diagnosticEvaluation
evidence --> diagnosticEvaluation
diagnosticEvaluation --> diagnosticInsight
diagnosticInsight --> mri : optional consumption
evidence --> mri
mri --> mriCandidate : when supported
mriCandidate --> systemEvaluation
evidence --> systemEvaluation
systemEvaluation --> systemInsight
numeric ..> trace
semantic ..> trace
outcomes ..> trace
diagnosticEvaluation ..> trace
diagnosticInsight ..> trace
mri ..> trace
systemEvaluation ..> trace
systemInsight ..> trace
note bottom of numericRules
  Definitions do not prescribe fixed confidence
  or priority. Existing configuration and ranking
  still contain static values; migration is unresolved.
end note
note bottom of semantic
  Initial target uses direct selected behaviours.
  BF01 runs independently of the numeric pipeline.
  Its candidate trace is visible in the console;
  eligibility and findings are not implemented.
  Numeric and semantic strategies are distinct.
end note
note bottom of profiles
  Planned user-facing role profiles also provide
  interpreted evidence, linked to original selections.
  No profiles are needed by the first engine.
end note
note bottom of diagnosticCandidate
  A trigger does not automatically produce an insight.
  The diagnostic owns this finding and interpretation.
end note
note bottom of mri
  System candidates require separate relationship
  evaluation, not just a diagnostic rule match.
  Both paths may reuse shared evaluation capabilities.
end note
@enduml
